WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:04.800
Meet Hybrid Swarm. Four simulated aircraft,
working across one shared environment.

00:04.800 --> 00:13.850
Each aircraft provides its own camera view,
giving the operator multiple perspectives on the mission.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000
The demonstration also presents a shared point cloud.

00:23.000 --> 00:29.000
Explore the reconstructed space from different viewpoints,
and review the scene alongside the aircraft views.

00:29.000 --> 00:34.000
This is a recorded simulation,
showing the current research prototype.
